Package: biol202
Title: Tutorials and Datasets for BIOL 202: Introduction to Biostatistics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jason", "Pither", , "pitherj@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Course materials for BIOL 202 (Introduction to Biostatistics)
    at UBC Okanagan: the documented teaching datasets used throughout the lab
    tutorials. Installing this package also installs every other R package the
    course requires, so students set up their environment in one step.
